ubee-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, May to June came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025 the middle saw 217% of normal in May to June and 43% of normal in August to September. Grid 16066 had its driest year in 1952 at 59% of normal.</p>"}
